                                    -20-
*****************************************************************************
                              Trouble Shooting
*****************************************************************************

Hi,

This is a quick and painless FAQ about ADF-DM, it will try and help you, if
you have a question please e-mail me, I`m a nice person and like people to
give me questions for this FAQ!

Q. I can create and view an ADF in ADF-DM, but UAE doesn`t like it!

A1. ADF-DM is Powerful, it can read disks that a real amiga wouldn`t touch,
    it doesn`t check data (so you won`t get any checksum errors), it just
    rips the data off. So any corrupt files are easily recovered.
A2. If you have TWO ADF's with the same name, then you can`t read any
    of them. UAE (AmigaDOS) will refuse to read it! Its not my fault, so
    simply rename the ADF's Root name.. This includes hard ADF's as well as
    disk based ones..

Q. I enter a file name into the file open dialog box, but ADF-DM just brings
   up an `empty` list of files/dirs..

A. Make sure the file really exists, because of the way ADF-DM is programmed
   it will `attempt` to open ANY file. If it doesn`t exist then ADF-DM will
   continue to read the ADF (but receive null data), this is a shortsight
   on me and will be corrected sometime..

Q. I upgraded from V1.50 to V1.5x and I get a `Type Mismatch error` when I
   try to run the new version.

A. Please contact myself via e-mail/snail mail to receive a `patch` program.
   Alternatively, backup all your file, format your HD and reinstall every
   thing including your new version of ADF-Suite..

Q. The icons along the top of the screen are all different sizes (big and
   small), and the drive selection (for DOS files) is all the screen
   slightly.

A. You are using `Large Fonts` most program don`t use large fonts as they
   assume your not blind. Change the setting to small fonts.



